{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "0cf115b50ae552b955c49c5639f1b41eb606dff09ee68eb3f9ebc7c541334791", "ja": "グレイト・アーティスト", "zh": "伟大艺术家", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fea9e3f6137d9fa8686be148c5a7413c3368db81a7b431236bc444682c70ff1e", "ja": "公演当日、開演間近、駆け込んできた杏奈が\nロコにスマホを見せる。ヨルノが自身の動画\nチャンネルで『レオ』への応援と、ロコへの\n感謝を述べている事を知り、感激するロコ。\n気持ちは高まり、いざステージへ！", "zh": "演出当天，临近开场时，匆匆赶来的杏奈把手机给ROCO看。她得知ヨルノ在自己的视频频道中为《レオ》加油，并向ROCO表达感谢后，ROCO感动不已。  \n情绪高涨，向舞台进发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "658696be182f534eed26b9cba8cb23df083d5a44625e1a61ecb3eb41070bd91f", "ja": "（いよいよ今日は、天体公演初日！\nそろそろ開場だけど、ロコ達の様子はどうかな？）", "zh": "（今天终于是天体公演的第一天！快要入场了，ROCO们现在怎么样了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b67299ea3da164c241d508f32842c5721549bba0fc0caef3fc0eea305eeee8a7", "ja": "おーい、みんな！　準備はどうだ？", "zh": "喂——大家！准备得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "63d0ad62ddb35c2399359411848640c8a07846eb4af76995b7223baf1f35869f", "ja": "ノープロブレムです！\nロコはバッチリ、プリパレーションできてますよ♪", "zh": "没问题！\nROCO已经做好充分准备了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "9038dce6685073e2504c0b477a9203f7dc685c0588471eb62666a2aec69cc000", "ja": "ウン、ワタシも大丈夫……あっ！？\nタオルの用意忘れちゃったヨ、ええと……。", "zh": "嗯，我也没问题……啊！？\n我忘了准备毛巾，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "fea0741ee1ca3af8ce5df132c7f5b5d2ac3a39986c983a40348315538bc782fa", "ja": "はい、エレナさん！　テーブルの上にあったよ。", "zh": "好的，艾莉娜！桌上有毛巾哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "71dcb2a61b42892486a616c2475713d775798f0743be82639c0483ff5ac240fd", "ja": "はい、どうぞ！　お水も忘れないでくださいね？\nライブ中の水分補給はマストですよ！", "zh": "好的，请用！也别忘了喝水哦？\n演出时补充水分可是必须的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "9e934a1bcbf088593a08d4f1a3a039b864c8cc63998396e9b3d1ea1754229dd8", "ja": "エヘヘッ、ふたりともありがと！\nそれじゃ、後は……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你们两个！\n那么，接下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "15502e406d468091a0cf867128f174ee8423f24a4b2770ec7e90fa82b76d08fa", "ja": "ハイ、笑顔チェック！　ロコとイクも、ほら！\nスマイルだヨ～♪", "zh": "好的，检查笑容！ROCO和育也来，快看！\n笑一个哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "4ea37c98683a0bdb94cc0239a3d76650fdaa31a9df66135deb2482902deedcb9", "ja": "うんっ！　えへっ♪", "zh": "嗯！诶嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "cc5043672bfa53c688ee470faeb872d13046aeb430147a1a7de6aa2e75421275", "ja": "え、えへへ……♪　……どうですか、エレナ！", "zh": "诶、诶嘿嘿……♪……怎么样，艾蕾娜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "73d41bd3ac6b1ab4bcbfb4eb97b452d87263f92d98e9f529cdd551bee446aaa2", "ja": "ウン！　ふたりとも、いい顔っ♪\nあとは3人で、いーっぱいライブ楽しもうね♪", "zh": "嗯！你们两个表情都很棒♪  \n接下来就和3个人一起，尽情享受演出吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1a641f9452a20c4229b3aa6508915c1a915135fab59f020674b2af4c33587064", "ja": "よし、じゃあそろそろ、舞台袖に……。", "zh": "好，那差不多该去侧台了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1012_se", "source_sha256": "8eb363af7a4988b86bfee0510c7f10ec1d6443e74df9ed837c329ebe0e386b59", "ja": "ガチャ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "cf7fc1d68ff1d852def837af61c1c03828f370c4fd461e727aaf38eb86ffd458", "ja": "あ……よかった……まだ移動してない……。\nはぁ、はぁ……ふぅ。", "zh": "啊……太好了……还没有移动……\n哈啊，哈啊……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a9a7ef83f5d5e25941024ac07f5d65082a2431cc26c8aaec1c93a7df2a2a288f", "ja": "杏奈？　それに、歌織さんも。\nそんなに慌てて、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "杏奈？还有歌织。\n这么慌慌张张的，发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "da9b428c975b9b36251c9608a14c54032b61b0b432842745ea5c10718bd9d4b2", "ja": "ええと……！　杏奈ちゃんが、本番前に、\nどうしてもロコちゃんに見せたいものがあるからって。", "zh": "那个……！杏奈说，无论如何都想在正式演出前给ROCO看看一样东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "6474a7338567c850ab224f71874371737028930e9267ae99fcb0f33894a96b84", "ja": "え？　ロコに……なんですか？", "zh": "诶？ROCO上……是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "3c90d6cd04d646a60f9c5c22194e5b341662c8aea4f455998908d14b5091459c", "ja": "見て、これ……。\nさっき、アップされたばかりの、動画……。", "zh": "你看，这个……。\n刚才才上传的，视频……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1018_yorunooruka", "source_sha256": "0f0583f4f3fd986e185f047727b6c7efeba5ac6433e5403ca330aec18c8c4ccd", "ja": "「こんにちは、こんばんは、ヨルノです。\n今日の動画は、なんだろう……応援動画、かな？」", "zh": "“大家好，晚上好，我是夜乃。\n今天的视频算是什么呢……加油视频，吧？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1019_yorunooruka", "source_sha256": "61f3c09ff58889bdb0a3d1976bd24e505c5a765c8d16704af5b980ea67924095", "ja": "「今日から765プロライブ劇場で、新しいイベントが\n開催されるので、その宣伝ってことで！」", "zh": "“因为今天起765艺能剧场会举办新的活动，\n所以就当做是为此做宣传啦！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "a3dcc800d16d8d5d29d59c5520e5a77f13f03d16d473c58afbdfa1b6c35413c4", "ja": "ワオ！？　これって……ヨルノが\n自分のチャンネルで宣伝してくれてる！？", "zh": "哇！？这不是……约尔诺在自己的频道里帮忙宣传吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1021_yorunooruka", "source_sha256": "edb7529e84a6440662f7903763c028b1f561f679eaf69880eb6bceeb9bb3ff9f", "ja": "「『レオ』の皆さんとは、今度販売される雑誌で、\n対談してるんで、詳しくは、概要欄をチェック！」", "zh": "“我和‘Leo’的各位在下次发售的杂志里\n进行了对谈，详情请查看简介栏！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "f449e2d44d3acd2ce125414b9c6f27309e995b46a006fedd1eba6a2b74a6c828", "ja": "わぁ……すごいすごいっ！", "zh": "哇……好厉害好厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "f911142a39023812669191376d03c122c9440afd4a8a0f6077c57bf7afe64f57", "ja": "ヨルノ……！", "zh": "夜之……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1024_yorunooruka", "source_sha256": "e9820238b82a580f14faaec96d6cd2a5e671f677f04d25bd6f1742388ae40cce", "ja": "「それと……伴田さん、本当にありがとう。\nキミは本当に凄いアーティストだ」", "zh": "「还有……伴田小姐，真的非常感谢你。\n你真的是位非常了不起的艺术家」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1025_yorunooruka", "source_sha256": "965cf81e5cf22c846964f9a3e8514e4448d5bf9e7fba0f761216d5a2ca4f6999", "ja": "「でも、ボクも負けないよ。\nそれじゃ、ヨルノでした。バイバイ！」", "zh": "“但是，我也不会认输哦。\n那么，夜野就先告辞啦。拜拜！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "87fcab4c398b5c95301a1b0f9b532f4b78cdd39090f142853722737f12fe7188", "ja": "ロコ……よかった、ね？", "zh": "ROCO……太好了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "01eef11f8e12ad5b3abebe6ee6e759e8f0af7acb0be3b4ae2a6ac1a7a77c787a", "ja": "ヨルノさん、楽しそうだったわね♪\nあの笑顔も、ロコちゃんのおかげだと思うわ。", "zh": "约鲁诺小姐，看起来很开心呢♪\n我想，那份笑容也是多亏了ROCO小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "673b17d9611914ea7d6b588518bed74ed5633aef77bc19f4462a74bf9deb10ab", "ja": "み、みんな……ううっ！　ハートが……。\nううっ、気持ちが収まりません！", "zh": "大、大家……呜呜！我的Heart……\n呜呜，这股心情根本平复不下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "d7657242d6e01cf311ff55f39085291b0a91512ca32ef9d33586e9dcee22243c", "ja": "このハピネス、このテンション……。\nオーディエンスのみんなにも、早く伝えたいです！", "zh": "这份幸福，这份热情……  \n我也想赶快传达给现场的大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "b14ff1f75817a3b7733efba22d6c8bc686eafbbad8da99d134295360c781e9d6", "ja": "スピリットをエクスプロージョンして、グレイトで\nワンダフルでヒストリカルなパフォーマンスを……！", "zh": "让精神彻底爆发，献上一场伟大、精彩又具有历史意义的表演……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "5201ad45d2deb79f0c162ab64207c5f921058bdcd30a0ae5fd4d05c324a00b9a", "ja": "ロ、ロコちゃん、ストップ！\nもう移動しなきゃ……おちついて！", "zh": "罗、ROCO，停下！得赶紧走了……冷静点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1033_p", "source_sha256": "0320753911bd0cd04c82e84533c92cf1349911c068512fa472e90454a5539d98", "ja": "よし……鉄は熱いうちに打てだ！\nみんな、この勢いのまま、公演を盛り上げてくれ！", "zh": "好……趁热打铁！\n大家，就顺着这股势头，把演出彻底炒热吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1034_025roc", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "40fd81dcc0d86d1b1b11d104d6eaf4ccda2b11265ed1a45d85dda67d0513fc9e", "ja": "ハーイだヨ～！", "zh": "嗨——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0253_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_06_1036_030iku", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
